  "title": "Player Studio",
  "text": "thumb\nPlayer Studio is a program that offered U.S. based players, 18 and older who have a Station Account in good standing, the opportunity to design potential in-game items to be sold through the SC Marketplace of their participating online game of choice.\n\nPlayers also receive the opportunity to suggest: the item name, item description, Station Cash value for the market, and rationale for how it fits into the ongoing storyline. If a player-created item is selected for inclusion in the SOE Marketplace, SOE will share 40% of the net amount it receives from the sale of the item with the player that created the item.\n\n(Players under 18 may participate with the help of a parent or a legal guardian).\n\nItems\n Name Designer Type Wave / Update Happy Heart T-Shirt  Eden Evergreen  T-Shirt  Wave 1 - 12/13/2012 Swirly Railed Gazebo  Emily Cabrian  Furniture  Wave 1 - 12/13/2012 Basic Blue T-Shirt  Danny Silvermeadow  T-Shirt  Wave 2 - 06/05/2013 Camo Combat T-Shirt  Shyshadow  T-Shirt  Wave 2 - 06/05/2013 Cheesy T-Shirt  Shyshadow  T-Shirt  Wave 2 - 06/05/2013 Gloam Memories T-Shirt  Kaleb Opaleyes  T-Shirt  Wave 2 - 06/05/2013 Hip-strap T-Shirt  Shyshadow  T-Shirt  Wave 2 - 06/05/2013 Lucky Clover T-Shirt  Shyshadow  T-Shirt  Wave 2 - 06/05/2013 Music Penguin T-Shirt  Danny Silvermeadow  T-Shirt  Wave 2 - 06/05/2013 Punky Plaid T-Shirt  Shyshadow  T-Shirt  Wave 2 - 06/05/2013 Amiable Apple T-Shirt  Eden Evergreen  T-Shirt  Wave 3 - 07/23/2013 Ancient Precursor T-Shirt  Shyshadow  T-Shirt  Wave 3 - 07/23/2013 Blue Bosun's Tunic  MasterMagnus  T-Shirt  Wave 3 - 07/23/2013 Gearbook Laptop  Firehawk894  Furniture  Wave 2 - 06/05/2013 Giraffe Safari T-Shirt  Soren aka \"Sren\"  T-Shirt  Wave 3 - 07/23/2013 Gleeful Gumdrop T-Shirt  Eden Evergreen  T-Shirt  Wave 3 - 07/23/2013 Fancy Flam"
